ading the line in a 4-4-2. Referee Bastien Dechepy (4.4 cards a game) is already in the numbers.","goals":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-3,"call":"Around 2.8 goals","text":"The numbers say 2.9 goals, partly because Lens have leaked heavily lately. Ivanović is confirmed out, which the numbers don't know, leaving Thauvin, Hazard and Sotoca with Sima only fit for the bench, and a new coach after a 9-1 defeat will want a solid first game; Gradit's absence at the back pulls slightly the other way, so I keep a small trim to about 2.8."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 9 corners","text":"The numbers say 9.4 corners. Lens are expected in a 3-4-3 with wing-backs Aguilar and Udol and Digard wants play down the flanks, while Toulouse play a 4-4-2; that is close to how both usually play, so I stay at 9.4."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 5 cards","text":"The numbers say 4.8 cards and already add Dechepy's strict record (about +15%) and past meetings. A first game under a new coach brings energy but also more attention to discipline, and nothing points either way, so I stay at 4.8."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 25 shots","text":"The numbers say 24.9 shots. Digard's pressing could add a few for Lens, but Toulouse create a lot without finishing and Lens are short of fit forwards; these balance out, so I stay at 24.9."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"lower","adjust_pct":-3,"call":"Around 8 or 9 on target","text":"The numbers say 8.8 shots on target. With Ivanović out, Sima only on the bench and Édouard injured (counted), Lens have less sharpness up front than the numbers allow for, so I trim a little, to about 8.5."},"sources":["https://www.lensois.com/rc-lens-toulouse-le-groupe-lensois-avec-des-retours-notables-en-defense-et-en-attaque/","https://www.lensois.com/rc-lens-toulouse-les-compos-probables-6/","https://www.madeinlens.com/matchday/2026-2027/rc-lens-toulouse-le-groupe-lensois-18-53277.html","https://www.butfo